lead:
  - "I started Laguna Beach Counseling in 2001 with a fairly simple conviction: that excellent clinical care and genuine human warmth could exist side by side, in the same room, without either one crowding out the other. I had trained plenty of therapists by then, and I had seen how easily a practice can start treating people like a caseload. I wanted to build the opposite of that."
  - "More than 30 years in, that conviction hasn't budged. The quality of the work matters more to me than the scale of the business. We're not serving a market here. We're serving our neighbors, the people I run into at the market and at the Susi Q, and I've built a team I genuinely trust to hold that same standard."
